The Alembic chain starts with revision `20261020_00`, which creates the
application tables and enum types. Revision `20261021_01` then adds query
indexes. Inspect the target database and Alembic revision before applying this
chain; an existing schema must not be stamped or migrated without review.

The initial migration is intentionally irreversible. Index removal is also
disabled to prevent accidental schema changes during downgrades.
